{"resourceIdentifier":"3997","resourceName":"Istanbul Avcikoru Landfill Gas to Electricity Project","description":"The project activity is a Landfill Gas Power Generating Plant. Electricity production will be done by burning the landfill gas. Landfill gas will be burned in gas engines and electrical energy will be obtained from the ends of the generator coupled to gas engines. Electrical energy to be taken from the ends of the generator will be increased to medium voltage level in transformers and given to the interconnected system. Whilst providing sustainable development benefits to the host communities and the host country, the project activity reduces greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions mainly by preventing GHG emissions, methane in particular, from being emitted directly to the atmosphere from waste at the solid waste disposal site that would be otherwise left to be decomposed; and by replacing the electricity that would have otherwise been generated by the national grid which is primarily dependent on fossil-fuel-based resources.","location":{"latitude":41.146069,"longitude":29.377462},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-12-29","endExclusive":"2023-01-29","endInclusive":"2023-01-28"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3997"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"KORFEZ ENERJI SAN. VE TIC. A.S."},{"type":"string","value":"ISTANBUL, Turkey"},{"type":"string","value":"02122218111"},{"type":"string","value":"ahmet.cicekci@yesilglobal.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3997"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1099925"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]}